{"unit_id":"yan9651688__dsh-file-checksum#feature-1","repo":"yan9651688/dsh-file-checksum","commit":"40e6ed8d85d96249278bfd6f7e0f13bd408d94bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-checksum 的功能「计算文件摘要」：通过 file_checksum 工具读取一个普通文件的原始字节并计算 SHA-256 或 SHA-512。调用时提供文件路径，可选指定算法；结果包含摘要、路径和字节数。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:70-89","index.js:107-140"]}
