{"unit_id":"yan9651688__dsh-file-checksum#feature-4","repo":"yan9651688/dsh-file-checksum","commit":"40e6ed8d85d96249278bfd6f7e0f13bd408d94bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-checksum 的功能「受限读取」：调用 file_checksum 对单个文件计算摘要，配置 maxBytes 限制完整读取的最大字节数；默认值为 64 MiB，超过限制的文件由文件系统读取调用拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-16","index.js:24-30","index.js:124"]}
